  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.56 - Analyzer hitlist hardening\n\n            Changed:\n            - AM004 unique-best fuzzy gate: per-property and aggregate Map-all use FindUniqueBestFuzzyMatch (same as AM006/AM011); name-distance ties withhold fuzzy map actions.\n            - AM032 nullable pass-through: pure return source / expression-bodied source to a nullable destination no longer reports AM032.\n            - AM003 sample isolation, AM004 aggregate UX docs, AM001↔AM002 ownership tests, AM030 signature-depth regressions.\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 (1363 tests)\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - Analyzer and test projects build clean under -warnaserror (the release gate)\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.55 - Analyzer health full reanalysis",
